    <body class="c29 c75">

        <p class="c1 c4" id="h.gjdgxs"><span class="c19 c5 c3"></span></p>
        <p class="c20"><span class="c19 c5 c3">RATING AGREEMENT </span></p>
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <p class="c1 c6"><span class="c19 c5 c3">{!Opportunity.MPRA_SoW_Reference_Number__c} </span></p>
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c0 c73 c42"></span></p>
        <p class="c1 c6"><span class="c2">Date: &nbsp;<apex:outputText value="{0,date,dd/MM/yyyy}" rendered="{!Opportunity.MPRA_Sent_Date__c!=null}"><apex:param value="{!Opportunity.MPRA_Sent_Date__c}" /></apex:outputText> 
            <apex:outputText value="{0,date,dd/MM/yyyy}" rendered="{!Opportunity.MPRA_Sent_Date__c==null}"><apex:param value="{!Today()}"/></apex:outputText> </span></p>
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <p class="c1 c6"><span class="c3"> <strong>{!oppContact.Salutation}&nbsp;{!oppContact.FirstName}&nbsp;{!oppContact.LastName}</strong> </span></p>
		<p class="c1 c6"><span class="c3"> <strong>{!oppContact.Designation__c}</strong> </span></p>
        <p class="c1 c6"><span class="c3"> <span class="c5 c3"><strong>{!Opportunity.Account.Name}</strong></span> </span></p>
        <p class="c1 c6"><span class="c3"> <span class="c5 c3"><strong>{!Opportunity.BillingAddress__r.Billing_Street__c}</strong></span></span></p>
        <p class="c1 c6"><span class="c3"> <span class="c5 c3"><strong>{!Opportunity.BillingAddress__r.Billing_City__c}&nbsp;{!Opportunity.BillingAddress__r.Billing_Zip_Postal_Code__c}</strong></span></span></p>
        <p class="c1 c6"><span class="c3"> <span class="c5 c3"><strong>{!Opportunity.BillingAddress__r.BillingState__c}</strong></span></span></p>
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <p class="c1 c6"><span class="c3"><span class="c5 c3">Dear</span>  <strong>{!oppContact.Salutation}&nbsp;{!oppContact.LastName},</strong>  </span></p>
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <p class="c1 c6"><span class="c5 c3"> Please refer your request to ICRA Limited (&ldquo;ICRA&rdquo;) seeking a Rating for Security Receipts of {!Opportunity.CurrencyIsoCode}&nbsp;<apex:outputText value="{0,number,#,##,##0.00}"> <apex:param value="{!Opportunity.VoD_in_crore__c}" /> </apex:outputText>/- Crores issued by</span> <span class="c3">{!Opportunity.Scheme_Trust_Name__c}</span> <span class="c5">(Trust)</span></p> 
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <p class="c1 c6"><span class="c3"> ICRA is pleased to take up your mandate and looks forward to carrying out the assignment once it has received your acceptance of the Terms of Rating Agreement as enumerated below. To indicate acceptance, please send us back the enclosed copy of this letter, duly signed by an authorised signatory of your company and bearing its official seal.</span></p>
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <p class="c1 c6"><span class="c19 c5 c3">TERMS OF RATING AGREEMENT</span></p>
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c19 c5 c3"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_7-0 start" start="1">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c19 c5 c3">Scope of Work and Rating Fee</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c19 c5 c3"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_12-0 start" start="1">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c2">ICRA shall, after due consideration, assign a Rating to aforesaid Security Receipts (SRs) and shall <span class="c5">keep the Rating under Surveillance during the life of the transaction, that is, till such time that any amount is outstanding against these SRs,</span> in case your company decides to accept the initial Rating or use it in any manner.</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4 c15"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_12-0" start="2">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c2">The Rating fee payable by your Company to ICRA is <span class="c5">{!Opportunity.CurrencyIsoCode}&nbsp;<apex:outputText value="{0,number,#,##,##0.00}"> <apex:param value="{!Opportunity.IRF_Final_Amount__c}" /> </apex:outputText>/-</span> plus applicable GST and/or any other applicable taxes. The Surveillance Fee from the second year onwards will be <span class="c5">{!Opportunity.CurrencyIsoCode}&nbsp; <apex:outputText value="{0,number,#,##,##0.00}"> <apex:param value="{!Opportunity.ASF_Final_Amount__c}" /> </apex:outputText></span>/-, plus applicable GST and/or any other applicable taxes, and shall be payable each year during the term of the Rating. The Surveillance Fee, which becomes chargeable after 12 months from the date of assignment of the initial Rating, will be payable in advance. 
                <span class="c3">
                    <apex:outputText rendered="{!Opportunity.OPE__c == 'Capped'}">
                        ICRA shall charge out-of-pocket expenses (“OPE”) on account of travel, hotel accommodation, and other expenses incurred at actuals subject to a cap of Rs. 
                        <apex:outputText value="{0,number,#,##}">
                            <apex:param value="{!Opportunity.Amt_of_CAP_fee__c}" />
                        </apex:outputText>.
                        Any such fees will be payable upon receipt of an invoice from ICRA.
                    </apex:outputText>
                    
                    <apex:outputText rendered="{!Opportunity.OPE__c == 'Absorbed'}">
                        ICRA shall absorb out-of-pocket expenses (“OPE”) on account of travel, hotel accommodation, and other expenses incurred at actuals.
                    </apex:outputText>
                    
                    <apex:outputText rendered="{!Opportunity.OPE__c == 'Reimbursed'}">
                        ICRA shall charge out-of-pocket expenses (“OPE”) on account of travel, hotel accommodation, and other expenses incurred at actuals.
                        Any such fees will be payable upon receipt of an invoice from ICRA.
                    </apex:outputText>
                </span>
                <span class="c5">All Fees as mentioned herein shall not be refundable under any circumstances.</span> ICRA is not providing and shall not provide any financial, legal, tax, advisory, consultative or business services to your company. The Rating opinion that ICRA provides or any discussion that your company may have with ICRA analysts shall not be deemed as advice on your company&rsquo;s business operations. </span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4 c15"><span class="c19 c5 c3"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_7-0" start="2">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c19 c5 c3">Acceptance/Non-Acceptance and Use of Rating</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c19 c5 c3"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_1-0 start" start="1">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c3">After ICRA has informed your Company of the Rating it has assigned, your Company shall communicate its decision to ICRA regarding its acceptance of the Rating in writing, and intended use of the Rating, in any manner, within 5 (five) working days of the assignment of the Rating. In the event your Company fails to notify ICRA of its decision regarding its acceptance/non-acceptance of the Rating or failed to appeal against the Rating during such 5 (five) working days acceptance time period, such failure shall be treated by ICRA as non-acceptance of the Rating. Any use by you of the Rating shall be deemed acceptance of the Rating...</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4 c15"><span class="c19 c5 c3"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_1-0" start="2"></ol>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_1-0" start="2">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c3">If the Rating is not accepted within the stipulated time, it shall remain confidential subject to the terms of this Agreement. On request, an unaccepted Rating may be converted to an accepted Rating, provided such request is made by your company within two months from the date ICRA first communicated its Rating decision to you. However, before such conversion is made, the Rating initially assigned may have to undergo a revalidation process. No additional fee would be charged to your company for the conversion, provided the composition of the underlying pool and structure of the assignment transaction has not changed, and provided the request for conversion comes in within 12 months from the date ICRA first communicated its Rating decision to you.</span></li>
        </ol>
        
        <p class="c1 c4 c15"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_7-0" start="3">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c5 c3">Tenure of Agreement</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4 c15"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_10-0 start" start="1">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c2">This Agreement shall remain valid till the Rating assigned is withdrawn. This Agreement cannot be terminated by your company once it has accepted the Rating.</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4 c15"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_7-0" start="4">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c19 c5 c3">Changes in Rating </span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c19 c5 c3"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_9-0 start" start="1">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c3">ICRA will keep the Rating under Surveillance until it is withdrawn. Following Surveillance, ICRA may reaffirm, upgrade, downgrade, suspend, or withdraw the Rating. In all cases, ICRA will communicate its decision to your company in writing.</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4 c15"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_9-0" start="2">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0" id="h.1fob9te"><span class="c2">If at any stage during the lifetime of the rated instrument, ICRA feels it is unable to carry out continuous monitoring of the Rating(s) assigned because of insufficiency of accurate information, whether owing to a lack of cooperation by your company or otherwise, ICRA will be entitled to carry out a review of the Rating(s) outstanding on the basis of the best available information. Further, ICRA shall also be entitled to disclose such Rating(s) or changes in Rating(s) along with the Rating rationale(s) in any manner and to anyone it may decide without any reference to your company.</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4 c15"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_9-0" start="3">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c2">At any stage, failure on your part to furnish such information as ICRA may require from time to time, or to timely and adequately answer queries that may be raised by ICRA could result in ICRA suspending, withdrawing, or revising the Rating assigned. </span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4 c15"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_9-0" start="4">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c2">Failure on your part to pay the Surveillance Fee, as and when due, could result in ICRA suspending, withdrawing, or revising the Rating previously assigned.</span></li>
        </ol>
		<p class="c1 c4 c15"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_9-0" start="5">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c2">At any point, if ICRA is of the opinion that the circumstances then prevailing justify change, suspension, or withdrawal of the Rating, or warrant that the Rating be maintained at the existing level, it shall have the right to take the appropriate Rating action, and such a decision shall be final and binding on your company.</span></li>
        </ol>
		<p class="c1 c4 c15"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_9-0" start="6">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c2">The ratings are specific to the terms and conditions as specified in the underlying transaction documents and as indicated to ICRA by you, and any change in the terms of the transaction would require a review of the ratings by ICRA. In case there is any change in the terms of the transaction, the same must be brought to our notice before the transaction is executed by you. In the event such changes occur after the ratings have been assigned by ICRA and their use has been confirmed by you, the ratings would be subject to ICRA&rsquo;s review, following which there could be a change in the ratings previously assigned.</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c27 c4 c83"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_7-0" start="5">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c19 c5 c3">Dissemination of Rating </span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_5-0 start" start="1">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c3">ICRA shall communicate its Rating decision in terms of assignment or change in Rating to you in writing. The right to accept and use the initial Rating will rest with your company. We understand that the assigned ratings/rationale will be kept private and in case you disclose the ratings to any third party, ICRA, too, reserves the right to disclose / publish the rating / rationale, if required.</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4 c15"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_5-0" start="2">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c3">ICRA reserves the right to disclose the Rating (whether accepted or not) to, inter alia, Government, Statutory, Regulatory, Judicial and Quasi-judicial authorities, bodies and/or Stock Exchanges where such disclosure is permitted or required by or under any law in force. In case of allegation of misstatement by your company, ICRA shall have the right to disclose the assigned Rating in public documents and/or publicity material and/or other forum.</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_7-0" start="6">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c19 c5 c3">Revalidation of Rating</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c19 c5 c3"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_4-0 start" start="1">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c2">If the instrument rated as above, is not issued by you within a period of 2 months from the date of the letter communicating the rating, the same would need to be revalidated before expiry of the 2 months. </span></li>
        </ol>        
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_7-0" start="7">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c5 c3">Suspension/Withdrawal of Rating</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4 c15"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_8-0 start" start="1">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c2">ICRA shall suspend/withdraw the assigned Rating in accordance with its suspension/withdrawal policy in force.</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_7-0" start="8">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c19 c5 c3">Documents Required</span></li>
