        <p class="c1 c4 c21"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_6-0 start" start="1">
            <li class="c1 c49 li-bullet-6"><span class="c2">Your company shall furnish to ICRA such information and clarifications as ICRA may require during the Rating exercise, Rating Surveillance, and over the period the Rating remains valid.</span></li>
        </ol>   
		<p class="c1 c4 c21"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_6-0" start="2">
            <li class="c1 c49 li-bullet-6"><span class="c2">Your company shall disclose to ICRA in writing all details relating to recoveries/ collections or redemption of SRs.</span></li>
        </ol>	
		<p class="c1 c4 c21"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_6-0" start="3">
            <li class="c1 c49 li-bullet-6"><span class="c2">Fees shall be paid by your company by way of cheque or demand draft (DD) or transfer through electronic medium in favour of ICRA Limited. </span></li>
        </ol>	
        <p class="c1 c4 c15"><span class="c19 c5 c3"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_7-0" start="9">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c19 c5 c3">Undertaking</span></li>			
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c19 c5 c3"></span></p>
		<p class="c1 c6"><span class="c19 c5 c3">You undertake:</span></p>
		<p class="c1 c4"><span class="c19 c5 c3"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_3-0 start" start="1">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c2">To provide ICRA with true, adequate and timely information as required by ICRA for assigning and/or monitoring the Rating(s).</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_3-0" start="2">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c2">To arrange for meetings of ICRA&rsquo;s representatives, whenever required by them, with your company&rsquo;s management.</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_3-0" start="3">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c2">To inform ICRA about any change in the terms and conditions or size of the underlying transaction before or after the execution of the transaction.</span></li>
        </ol>        
        <p class="c1 c4 c21"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_7-0" start="10">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c19 c5 c3">Warranty</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c19 c5 c3"></span></p>
		<p class="c1 c6"><span class="c19 c3">You warrant that neither your Company nor any other &lsquo;party concerned&rsquo; (as defined hereunder) is subject to individual or country sanctions imposed by the United Nations, United States, European Union, or United Kingdom (&ldquo;Sanctions&rdquo;) by virtue of (i) being on a published sanctions list or (ii) located in a sanctioned country (any person or entity described in (i) or (ii) being a &ldquo;Sanctions Target&rdquo;), or (iii) owned (50% or more) or controlled by one or more Sanctions Target(s).  The term &lsquo;party concerned&rsquo; includes any applicant, issuer, originator, guarantor, sponsor, or borrower participating in any rated transaction hereunder. If any rating to be provided hereunder is for asset-backed securities or specific project finance activity, you warrant that (i) no asset that forms any part of the collateral underlying the rated asset-backed securities or (ii) no such specific project finance activity, as applicable, is subject to any prohibition or restriction under Sanctions.  You agree to notify ICRA forthwith if any of these warranties cease to be accurate, and that if ICRA determines it is prohibited by any applicable law or regulation from providing any of the services hereunder it may terminate such services to the extent permitted under any applicable law.</span></p>        
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c2"></span></p>        
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_7-0" start="11">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c19 c5 c3">Confidentiality and Indemnification</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4 c15"><span class="c2"></span></p>
		<ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_3-0 start" start="1">
		<li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c2">All materials and information given to ICRA for the Rating shall become the property of ICRA on the express understanding that such information shall be used only for the purpose of Rating/monitoring, subject however to ICRA&rsquo;s right to make available such materials and information to, inter alia, Government, Statutory, Regulatory, Judicial and Quasi-judicial authorities/bodies and/or Stock Exchanges where such disclosure is permitted or required by or under any law in force. In addition to the above, ICRA shall not be bound by the obligation of confidentiality in respect of such information that has already fallen into public domain or has also been disclosed to any third party.</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c6"><span class="c19 c3"></span></p>
		<ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_3-0" start="2">
		<li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c2">Notwithstanding anything to the contrary mentioned in this document, you further agree and undertake to indemnify ICRA, its Directors, Rating Committee members, officers and employees against all or any costs, losses and damages, including but not limited to attorney’s or consultant’s fees paid/incurred due to suppression of facts/information by you and/or as a result of any false, inaccurate or misleading information of any nature, provided by you to ICRA, on which ICRA may have relied in any manner, to assign the Credit Rating.</span></li>
        </ol>
		<p class="c1 c6"><span class="c19 c3"></span></p>
		<p class="c1 c6"><span class="c19 c3"></span></p>
		<p class="c1 c6"><span class="c19 c3"></span></p>
		
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_7-0" start="12">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c19 c5 c3">Limitation of liability </span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c19 c5 c3"></span></p>
        <p class="c1 c6"><span class="c19 c3">Notwithstanding anything to the contrary contained in this Agreement, to the extent permitted by applicable law no one in ICRA will be liable in contract, tort (including negligence), statutory duty or otherwise to anyone (including you) for any loss, liability, claim, injury or cost, whether direct or indirect and however caused (including by any contingency within or beyond the control of anyone in ICRA), arising from or in connection with this Agreement or ICRA&rsquo;s services, including: (i) the procuring, compilation, analysis, interpretation, communication, dissemination, or delivery of any information or Rating; (ii) the withdrawal of any Rating and any associated disclosure; (iii) the inability to issue or monitor a Rating due to legislative, judicial or administrative decisions; (iv)any change in ICRA&rsquo;s methodologies; (v) any unauthorized publication, unauthorized use or any misuse; or (vi) any reliance otherwise acknowledged as inappropriate; and</span></p>
		<p class="c1 c4"><span class="c19 c5 c3"></span></p>
        <p class="c1 c6"><span class="c19 c3">In any event, the aggregate liability of the ICRA for any reason whatsoever related to this Agreement or our services will not be more than the Rating fee or Surveillance fee paid by you for the relevant Rating(s) during the 12 (twelve) months prior to breach provided that nothing in this Agreement attempts to limit or exclude ICRA&rsquo;s liability for fraud, wilful misconduct or any other type of liability that under applicable law cannot be limited or excluded.</span></p>
        <p class="c1 c4 c15"><span class="c2"></span></p>		
        
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_7-0" start="13">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c5 c3">Disclaimer</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4 c15"><span class="c0 c73 c42"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_15-0 start" start="1">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c2">Rating(s) assigned by ICRA is not to be construed, under any circumstances, as an audit   opinion.</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4 c15"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_15-0" start="2">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c2">The Rating(s) assigned must be understood solely as an opinion and should not be treated, or cause to be treated, as recommendation to buy, sell, or hold the rated SRs.</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4 c15"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_15-0" start="3">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c2">When determining the rating, ICRA relies on the current information available/made available to it and not on any subsequent information. ICRA does not guarantee the completeness or accuracy of the information on which the rating is based.</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4 c15 c29"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_7-0" start="14">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c19 c5 c3">Governing Law </span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4 c15"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_15-0 start" start="1">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c3">This Agreement shall be governed by the laws of India and subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Delhi.</span></li>
        </ol>
		<p class="c1 c4 c15"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_15-0 " start="2">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c3">Since Asset Reconstruction Companies are regulated by RBI, any future changes in the guidelines issued by RBI relating to the rating of security receipts, if required may be suitably incorporated in this agreement from time to time.</span></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="c1 c4 c15"><span class="c2"></span></p>
        <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_7-0" start="15">
            <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c19 c5 c3">Miscellaneous</span></li>
